{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56259","headline":"秋山图歌 · 徐光溥","name":"秋山图歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空（按：《全唐诗》卷七六一题作《题黄居宷秋山图》，今从《王氏画苑丛书》本《益州名画录》卷中。\n其第十七、十八句，《全唐诗》作「月槛参桥□，僧老坐搘筇」，检《益州名画录》，此段应作：「月槛参差锦绣跃，星坛斑驳翠苔封。\n傍岸牛羸行嚼草，过桥僧老坐嗜筇。\n」《全唐诗》殆脱去十八字，今爲补出。\n全诗甚长，不重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐光溥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}